# Sample .gitignore for .booth/shared/home/coder/.mozilla/firefox/
# Copy into the shared firefox/ tree when committing team state.
# Profiles are named by Firefox (e.g. *.default-release/); paths below are globs.

*
!.gitignore
!.mount-this
!profiles.ini
!installs.ini
!*.default*/
!*.default*/**

# Drop noisy / sensitive pieces even inside the profile
**/*cookies*
**/logins.json
**/key4.db
**/cert9.db
**/storage/**
**/cache2/**
**/startupCache/**
**/shader-cache/**
**/datareporting/**
**/saved-telemetry-pings/**
**/*parentlock*
